WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
The nose is the most prominent feature of the face.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.840
It is the central point of the face

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.680
and it's the feature that can most influence

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.040
all the areas in the face.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.360
That is why any change we make to the nose,

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.920
no matter how small,

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.520
will affect the appearance of your face.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.920
That's why when you're choosing the professional

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.680
to perform a rhinoplasty,

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.160
it's very important that you make sure

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.960
that he or she is qualified

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.040
and has the necessary experience

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.560
to understand what you want to achieve

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.880
and give you a safe and satisfactory result.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.520
Let me introduce myself.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.640
I'm Dr. Fulvio Correa,

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.800
a board certified plastic surgeon.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.640
Through our all-inclusive program

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.520
that we have designed especially for patients,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.960
come from other countries like you.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.360
My staff will accompany you

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.640
in every phase of the journey.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.360
Answering all your questions,

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.120
helping you to plan your trip,

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.960
scheduling your accommodation in our recovery house,

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.120
where you will have all the comforts and care necessary

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.720
for a prompt and satisfactory recovery.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.160
Schedule your free evaluation right now

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.560
and start your journey to achieve your goals

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.000
and boost your confidence.
